  "description": "Interpreted Angular-style HTML template engine for .NET — no runtime compilation, so it runs under Native AOT, trimming, Azure Functions and C# scripts where Razor-based engines can't. Thread-safe immutable AST, pipes, directives, server components, [if]/[for]/[not-empty] and @if/@else/@for control-flow, && / || conditions, and per-template AST caching. Zero third-party dependencies — a purpose-built HTML template parser produces structurally-correct, escaped output.",
  "id": "NgSharp",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-07-28T07:30:37.473Z",
